<<~ ahu #contract >>

!! Contract

`<$kumu>` resolves a named kumu device by `[all[tiddlers]tag[$:/tags/LarariumKumu]field:kumu-name[name]]`, transcluding it with props. Renders a `<div data-lar-kind="kumu">` container; unresolved devices show a `<span data-lar-kind="hole">`. Attributes: `name`, `props`.

<<~/ahu >>

<<~ ahu #source >>

The code-file tiddler holds the source; this slot holds a WINDOW onto it, never a copy. One home
for the code — shipped by the plugin, or minted at promotion — and the anchor keeps the rope.

<$transclude $tiddler="lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/tw5/widgets/kumu" $mode="block"/>

<<~/ahu >>

